# AsWish build / IDE artifacts
bin/
dcu/
dist/
__history/
*.local
*.identcache
*.tvsconfig
*.dsk
*.~*
*.~~*

# Compiled binaries (regenerable via dcc64)
*.exe
*.dll
*.bpl
*.dcu
*.res
# ...except AsWish.res: AsWish.dpr has {$R *.res}, so a clean clone fails with
# E1026 File not found: 'AsWish.res' without it. It is the compiled app
# icon/version resource from the tracked AsWish.ico, not a build by-product.
!AsWish.res

# Test run output (regenerable)
tests/dunitx-results.xml

# Temporary debug projects in tests/ (ad-hoc scratch programs)
tests/_debug*.dpr
tests/_debug_parser.dpr

# External article copies
docs/refs/

# Internal governance, workorders and private discussion files (不进公开仓库，同 WO/ 一类)
.AsWish/
.ai-workbench/
_repro/
_audit_out.txt
_audit_err.txt
err_file
out_file
# SPW 证据包与观测材料派生产物（WO-20261006-0102：即使误落仓库根亦被忽略，第二道防线）
spw-evidence-*.json
obs_material*.json
boundary.json
bugfix.md
tasks.md
history.md
workorders/
发散讨论/
root.txt
root.txt.example
*.db
AsWishConfig.db

# Tool configs
.claude/
.vscode/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Build logs
compile_log.txt
compile_output.txt
cli/cli_build.txt
tests/test_build.txt
tests/test_run.txt
_handoff/
dogfood_*/
# 门禁凭据例外：tools/spw-gates/gate-run/（gate_run_results.json + 12 份 gate_*.log）
# 是 PASS/FAIL 的唯一真值源，必须受版本控制，不得再挪回 ignore 目录（WO-20261005-0098）。
dogfood_*/
scratch_*/
batch_dogfood/

# Fixtures
tools/gui-verify-fixture/mirror/

# Local runtime state (never tracked — see WO-20261005-0094)
.workbuddy/
.claude/sessions/
